WEBVTT

00:05.550 --> 00:08.520
I can't believe you did that for me.

00:08.520 --> 00:11.530
Nobody asked you. Asshole.

00:12.120 --> 00:16.610
I'm through with owing 
anybody anything, got it?

00:17.490 --> 00:20.490
So once you're out of here, we're even!

00:30.170 --> 00:31.470
It's over...

00:49.270 --> 00:53.230
I knew you were alive, Chainsaw!

00:59.640 --> 01:01.830
Yeow!

01:03.170 --> 01:05.140
All better!

01:06.560 --> 01:08.370
This is pointless, Chainsaw!

01:08.370 --> 01:09.720
The pain!

01:09.720 --> 01:11.340
It hurts!

01:11.340 --> 01:14.120
You won't find my heart in here!

01:14.120 --> 01:15.390
You can't kill me!

01:26.760 --> 01:27.810
A devil?!

01:28.250 --> 01:29.810
This bodes ill.

01:30.250 --> 01:32.860
Denji's losing blood ceaselessly.

01:32.860 --> 01:36.200
When he's lost too much, 
his chainsaws will retract.

01:42.080 --> 01:45.200
You are so much weaker now.

01:45.200 --> 01:48.140
How far you have fallen, Chainsaw?!

03:31.760 --> 03:33.670
My chainsaws are in?

03:33.670 --> 03:35.480
Need more blood!

03:35.480 --> 03:37.150
You've failed!

03:37.150 --> 03:38.080
Die!

03:38.080 --> 03:39.600
Chainsaw!

03:48.740 --> 03:51.750
This blood might seriously taste like shit...

03:52.020 --> 03:55.750
But watching you shriek in pain...

03:55.750 --> 03:59.420
Makes it sweet like strawberry jam!

04:01.830 --> 04:04.680
The hunters that devils fear...

04:08.510 --> 04:11.430
are the ones with a couple of screws loose.

04:15.150 --> 04:17.690
Sahara had his head on straight...

04:18.610 --> 04:20.440
So he died.

04:20.830 --> 04:26.070
Same goes for Kinouchi, 
and Subaru, and Sasaki. All sane.

04:26.070 --> 04:29.900
They were reasonable enough 
to fear attacks from a devil,

04:29.900 --> 04:32.750
and that fear made the devils stronger.

04:34.190 --> 04:37.840
You been working with Aki for a while now.
 What do you think about him?

04:38.840 --> 04:40.130
Is his head on straight?

04:40.130 --> 04:44.840
I wouldn't say that about anyone 
who's trying to kill the Gun Devil.

04:45.390 --> 04:49.600
Didn't you join Public Safety because
 you were after the Gun Devil, too?

04:50.140 --> 04:52.970
You got any screws loose?

04:53.810 --> 04:55.230
No, sir.

04:55.690 --> 04:56.930
Exactly.

04:56.930 --> 05:02.740
Most hunters, including you, 
are out to put the Gun Devil down.

05:02.740 --> 05:05.800
They're earnest. Honest. Straightforward.

05:05.800 --> 05:09.540
And that means the devils know 
exactly how to fuck with them.

05:10.370 --> 05:15.250
But there's no telling what 
a crazy person's thinking.

05:15.610 --> 05:18.890
And even devils are afraid 
of what they don't understand.

05:21.540 --> 05:23.900
You're drinking too much again, master.

05:23.900 --> 05:26.040
See, that's being sensible again.

05:26.040 --> 05:29.010
Can't be unhinged without 
loosening the screws a bit every day.

05:34.690 --> 05:37.710
And if you're still visiting your 
partners' graves every month,

05:37.710 --> 05:39.280
then yours are still pretty tight.

05:40.420 --> 05:41.940
I'm heading home.

05:41.940 --> 05:45.150
Aki's still a punk, so make 
sure to work him over.

05:45.840 --> 05:47.530
I'll take it one step at a time.

05:48.160 --> 05:49.780
Not good enough.

05:50.390 --> 05:54.030
The kid's serious about 
collecting the meat chunks, right?

05:54.030 --> 05:57.130
He's gonna actually find 
the Gun Devil if he does.

06:12.620 --> 06:13.560
No...

06:13.560 --> 06:16.890
No, no, no, no, no, no—

06:18.730 --> 06:19.900
No.

06:20.500 --> 06:24.750
Aki, you wanna join 
the private sector with me?

06:25.730 --> 06:28.630
I received a pretty generous offer!

06:28.630 --> 06:31.130
Instead of chasing the Gun,

06:31.130 --> 06:36.060
we could go out for lunch, 
see a movie on the way home,

06:36.060 --> 06:37.930
and really enjoy ourselves.

06:39.280 --> 06:41.790
If you wanna go out 
for drinks, I'll join you.

06:41.790 --> 06:44.800
But I have no intention 
of ever going private.

06:45.380 --> 06:46.970
And I'll take your almond tofu.

06:48.440 --> 06:50.800
Then hand me a cigarette in exchange.

06:58.590 --> 07:02.810
If Aki fights the Gun Devil, he's gonna die.

07:03.700 --> 07:06.680
Not because we're too weak,

07:06.680 --> 07:10.140
or because it's the kind of devil that 
can kill hundreds of people in seconds.

07:11.290 --> 07:16.150
It's because Aki's cool, 
and serious, and kind...

07:17.010 --> 07:19.180
and normal, like most people.

07:20.790 --> 07:21.600
But...

07:23.540 --> 07:24.750
Take that!

07:26.290 --> 07:28.820
Ow, ow!

07:33.210 --> 07:34.530
It...

07:34.530 --> 07:35.680
It's over.

07:41.320 --> 07:42.600
But him?

07:43.320 --> 07:45.360
Eureka, dude.

07:46.850 --> 07:50.130
I cut you up, and you bleed.

07:50.130 --> 07:53.320
I drink that blood and heal!

07:53.740 --> 07:57.910
I'm a fucking perpetual motion machine!

07:58.850 --> 08:02.590
That Nobel Prize is mine!

08:05.780 --> 08:08.750
I've never seen anyone crazier than him,

08:09.320 --> 08:12.010
so maybe he can kill the Gun Devil!

08:24.990 --> 08:26.710
Pain...

08:28.760 --> 08:30.440
Ow, ow...

08:34.650 --> 08:35.780
It hurts...

08:38.970 --> 08:41.580
You still alive, Aki?

08:44.530 --> 08:45.860
How long...

08:46.620 --> 08:48.540
How long has it been?

08:49.210 --> 08:52.670
About three days since 
you got stabbed, I think?

08:53.340 --> 08:54.930
Meowy...

08:55.380 --> 08:58.440
Let's all go out for drinks.

08:59.170 --> 09:02.680
Since it's over... I'm gonna sleep a bit.

09:03.850 --> 09:05.290
It's over?

09:07.310 --> 09:09.940
This is my weakness...

09:09.940 --> 09:11.320
It's my heart.

09:11.320 --> 09:12.130
Please kill me.

09:12.130 --> 09:13.190
I'm sorry.

09:13.190 --> 09:14.160
I apologize.

09:14.160 --> 09:15.070
It hurts...

09:15.070 --> 09:17.600
What, already?!

09:17.600 --> 09:22.080
I was still having fun! 
It was like being in a pool!

09:25.330 --> 09:26.120
AUTOMATED

09:25.330 --> 09:26.120
AUTOMATED

09:25.330 --> 09:26.120
DOORS

09:25.330 --> 09:26.120
DOORS

09:25.330 --> 09:26.120
PLEASE

09:25.330 --> 09:26.120
PLEASE

09:33.180 --> 09:34.630
We're out.

09:37.850 --> 09:41.770
Got a piece of the Gun Devil's flesh,
 the sky is clear...

09:41.770 --> 09:44.270
And I'm feeling good, 
like I just took a huge shit.

09:44.270 --> 09:46.460
It's like I'm floating...

09:48.560 --> 09:49.460
Whoa there.

09:51.450 --> 09:52.650
He's out...

09:53.370 --> 09:56.400
Makes sense, considering he was fighting 
the devil the whole time without sleeping.

09:58.290 --> 10:01.660
We'll get Aki and Denji to a hospital.

10:02.050 --> 10:05.140
You two head back 
to the office and check in.

10:12.830 --> 10:14.780
A welcoming party?

10:14.780 --> 10:15.720
Yep.

10:15.720 --> 10:18.540
Since the full Division 4 
is finally assembled,

10:18.540 --> 10:20.310
we ought to get to know each other better,

10:20.310 --> 10:23.450
and deal with some of our outstanding issues.

10:23.450 --> 10:24.580
What issues?

10:24.580 --> 10:29.810
Well, the thing is, Kobeni and Arai 
are talking about quitting Public Safety.

10:29.810 --> 10:32.480
Not only are they afraid of the devils,

10:32.480 --> 10:35.320
they feel pretty guilty 
about trying to kill Denji, too.

10:36.120 --> 10:38.700
You tried to kill him, too.

10:38.700 --> 10:39.890
I know, right?!

10:39.890 --> 10:43.230
Kids these days! They're so sensitive.

10:43.230 --> 10:46.200
Would it kill them to be a little bolder?

10:46.950 --> 10:50.380
Over drinks, they'll be able to 
apologize to Denji easily,

10:50.380 --> 10:52.720
and we'll be able to 
convince them to not quit.

10:52.720 --> 10:54.250
You're just in this for drinks.

10:56.460 --> 10:58.760
It wasn't much, but I found 
a chunk of its flesh.

10:59.630 --> 11:02.250
If we're doing this, 
it needs to be this week.

11:02.250 --> 11:03.850
Why's that?

11:04.210 --> 11:07.070
If we're having a drinking party, 
I want to invite Ms. Makima.

11:14.400 --> 11:17.050
She's going on a business trip 
to Kyoto next week.

11:17.050 --> 11:21.240
With so many devils targeting Denji, 
she's looking into getting reinforcements.

11:21.240 --> 11:23.380
So the party needs to be this week.

11:26.340 --> 11:27.740
Be honest with me.

11:28.170 --> 11:30.370
What do you think Denji is?

11:32.120 --> 11:35.770
That devil seemed to know about him,

11:35.770 --> 11:37.880
and I've never seen anything 
like what he turned into.

11:37.880 --> 11:42.630
But the biggest mystery is how much 
Ms. Makima seems to be interested in him.

11:44.640 --> 11:48.730
She used to travel all the time, 
but she's stuck to Tokyo lately,

11:48.730 --> 11:50.560
and that's probably because of Denji.

11:51.300 --> 11:54.270
Does she know his secret?

11:58.320 --> 12:00.280
Wanna get her hammered and ask about it?

12:02.810 --> 12:04.280
Cheers!

12:04.280 --> 12:07.040
Man, all this stuff smells awesome!

12:07.040 --> 12:10.660
This is enough food for a lifetime!

12:08.090 --> 12:09.570
That's the stuff!

12:15.410 --> 12:17.210
Oh, here we go.

12:16.520 --> 12:18.770
This is nuts!

12:17.210 --> 12:18.770
Here's your plate.

12:18.770 --> 12:20.900
Where do I even start? 
It all smells great.

12:20.900 --> 12:24.060
This is good. It's been six months 
since I last had anything to drink.

12:24.060 --> 12:26.600
I only drink a bit at home, too.

12:26.600 --> 12:28.170
Away with you!

12:28.170 --> 12:29.970
The sashimi shall all be mine!

12:29.970 --> 12:32.480
What even is this? Looks tasty!

12:33.510 --> 12:37.230
Sorry... I got a little lost.

12:37.230 --> 12:40.110
Kobe, Kobe! Right over here!

12:40.110 --> 12:42.240
Ms. Makima says she'll be late.

12:44.330 --> 12:45.630
Three parfaits.

12:45.630 --> 12:46.650
And then...

12:47.200 --> 12:49.370
Three shiratama dumpling trays.

12:50.140 --> 12:53.170
I've never had anything this good before.

12:53.170 --> 12:56.330
You send most of your pay home, right?

12:56.330 --> 12:57.400
Be sure to eat your fill.

12:57.400 --> 12:58.840
Hands off, you scoundrel!

12:58.840 --> 13:01.130
The fried chicken is all mine!

13:01.750 --> 13:04.850
You didn't bring your Fiend, Fushi?

13:04.850 --> 13:07.650
They're a little too scary 
for a place like this.

13:07.650 --> 13:11.520
I envy how reasonable yours is, Hayakawa.

13:11.810 --> 13:12.520
Hey!

13:12.520 --> 13:15.340
You're young, so order 
whatever you want! And eat up!

13:15.340 --> 13:18.550
Damn it! I can't read most of these kanji...

13:16.270 --> 13:20.270
m 225 15 l 225 48 422 48 422 15

13:16.270 --> 13:20.270
Kisu Tempura

13:23.100 --> 13:25.460
So... about that kiss...

13:28.160 --> 13:30.770
I'm too bashful to do it right now.

13:30.770 --> 13:32.540
Let me drink a bit more first.

13:35.040 --> 13:37.700
I'll make it a juicy one, too.

13:37.700 --> 13:41.420
So will you forgive us 
for trying to kill you?

13:41.420 --> 13:44.390
Dude, all is forgiven! Super forgiven!

13:45.180 --> 13:48.900
This is a welcoming party for the rookies, 
so stand up and introduce yourselves!

13:49.330 --> 13:52.140
Your name, age, and the devil 
you're contracted with!

13:52.530 --> 13:55.620
Don't reveal your devil contract in public.

13:55.620 --> 13:59.240
You shouldn't share that 
with anyone you don't trust.

13:59.240 --> 14:01.810
Man, you never loosen up, do you?

14:01.810 --> 14:05.070
Aw, it's fine! It's probably fine.

14:05.530 --> 14:07.470
I wanna know hobbies, too.

14:07.470 --> 14:09.450
They tell you a lot about a person.

14:09.820 --> 14:13.270
I'm Denji. I'm 16, if I remember right.

14:13.270 --> 14:16.450
My hobbies are eating and sleeping!

14:17.410 --> 14:18.580
Yikes, that is young.

14:19.410 --> 14:21.680
You didn't drink, did you?!

14:21.680 --> 14:22.460
Just tea.

14:23.020 --> 14:26.000
I'm Hirokazu Arai! I'm 22 years old!

14:26.000 --> 14:27.960
I've got a contract with the Fox Devil!

14:27.960 --> 14:29.590
My hobby is writing haiku!

14:30.170 --> 14:32.720
That's the same devil as Hayakaptain.

14:32.720 --> 14:35.960
The Fox Devil is friendly toward humans.

14:35.960 --> 14:38.360
She's got contracts with a lot of hunters.

14:38.360 --> 14:41.530
But she only lets hot ones call on her head!

14:41.530 --> 14:43.730
As devils go, she's down bad.

14:45.300 --> 14:47.210
I'm Kobeni Higashiyama.

14:47.210 --> 14:48.480
I'm 20...

14:48.480 --> 14:51.710
I've got a devil contract... 
but it's a secret.

14:51.710 --> 14:54.670
My hobby is eating tasty things.

14:55.290 --> 14:56.720
Isn't her outfit cute?

14:56.720 --> 14:57.370
Yeah.

14:57.720 --> 14:59.870
It's a hand-me-down from my sister.

14:59.870 --> 15:03.630
Kobeni has eight sisters. Isn't that crazy?

15:00.220 --> 15:03.630
Hey, where's your rookie, Fushi?

15:03.900 --> 15:06.630
I'm sad to report that they 
were killed yesterday.

15:08.540 --> 15:10.360
Rest in peace!

15:10.360 --> 15:14.010
They will be... mist... pissed... missed?

15:14.010 --> 15:15.890
Already wasted, huh?

15:17.650 --> 15:20.230
Do people really die that often?

15:20.230 --> 15:23.520
Public Safety handles the devils 
too tough for the private sector.

15:24.060 --> 15:26.170
Yeah, we're always dropping like flies.

15:26.170 --> 15:28.900
No one who joined up at the 
same time as me is still alive.

15:28.900 --> 15:33.160
Denji's not gonna die, 
cuz he wants a smooch!

15:35.420 --> 15:37.900
Himeno gets really friendly 
when she's drunk.

15:38.930 --> 15:42.790
I'm pretty sure she's kissed everyone here,
 apart from the rookies.

15:42.790 --> 15:44.670
There's no escaping her.

15:47.540 --> 15:48.800
That's a guaranteed kiss!

15:51.800 --> 15:55.260
Today's the day... of my first kiss.

15:55.610 --> 15:56.550
What kiss?

15:57.520 --> 15:59.460
Ms. Makima!

15:59.460 --> 16:02.390
Excuse me, I'd like a draft beer.

16:02.880 --> 16:05.200
Have a seat, Ms. Makima.

16:07.730 --> 16:10.280
I've never seen her in person before.

16:12.290 --> 16:14.660
So, are you kissing someone, Denji?

16:14.660 --> 16:15.900
No, ma'am!

16:15.900 --> 16:19.040
Aw, are we not gonna kiss, Denji?!

16:19.040 --> 16:20.570
We are!

16:23.640 --> 16:26.040
Excuse me. Another beer.

16:28.390 --> 16:30.010
So, what's this about kisses?

16:30.010 --> 16:33.930
I don't want Ms. Makima 
to see me kiss Himeno.

16:34.350 --> 16:36.090
No smoochies?

16:36.090 --> 16:40.060
But I want a kiss with tongue 
just as bad!

16:40.560 --> 16:43.060
I've gotta try and change the subject!

16:43.060 --> 16:47.990
Ms. Makima! Y'know, I got one 
of them Gun Devil thingies!

16:47.990 --> 16:51.320
Yes, I heard. That's very impressive, Denji.

16:51.720 --> 16:56.730
We've never seen devils appearing with 
Gun Devil flesh this frequently before.

16:56.730 --> 16:59.420
Given how the most recent one 
was targeting Denji,

16:59.420 --> 17:02.080
something must be going on.

17:02.440 --> 17:06.180
Do you know what Denji's deal is, ma'am?

17:08.140 --> 17:09.340
Relinquish that!

17:11.520 --> 17:12.590
That, too, is mine!

17:16.660 --> 17:19.100
I'll tell you if you can outdrink me.

17:21.510 --> 17:23.350
Two more beers, please.

17:24.840 --> 17:28.230
I want in on that! Make it three!

17:28.230 --> 17:30.360
Horse sashimi! Fried chicken! 
And more horse sashimi!

17:30.360 --> 17:31.820
Fried chicken!

17:37.650 --> 17:38.780
That's mine, too.

17:38.780 --> 17:41.330
Another beer, if you would.

17:41.880 --> 17:43.880
You're pretty impressive, Power.

17:43.880 --> 17:47.660
There aren't a lot of Fiends 
who can control their urge to kill.

17:47.660 --> 17:50.340
A feat of my advanced IQ!

17:50.340 --> 17:55.360
Is IQ part of it? How high is yours, then?

17:55.880 --> 17:56.720
Um... 100?

17:56.720 --> 17:58.630
Is that high?

17:58.630 --> 18:01.500
I think my score was around 100, too.

18:01.500 --> 18:02.970
Then it was 120.

18:03.350 --> 18:05.950
If I remember right, Fushi's is high.

18:05.950 --> 18:07.710
Specifically, 134.

18:07.710 --> 18:10.640
Wow, must be proud enough
to actually remember it.

18:11.110 --> 18:13.880
If I recall, mine was 500?

18:13.880 --> 18:14.860
Perhaps 1000?

18:19.610 --> 18:20.870
Oh my.

18:25.500 --> 18:26.750
She's watching!

18:26.750 --> 18:28.120
Ms. Makima's watching.

18:28.590 --> 18:29.700
But what is this?

18:29.010 --> 18:30.420
The kiss is afoot!

18:29.700 --> 18:31.500
Is that a tongue I feel?

18:31.500 --> 18:34.090
Feels good... soft! Really soft!

18:34.090 --> 18:36.010
What the hell?! It's her tongue...

18:36.010 --> 18:38.070
But it's melting in my mouth?!

18:38.070 --> 18:39.880
That's... not... a tongue!

18:40.480 --> 18:41.890
It's puke!

18:44.510 --> 18:46.640
Well, that's traumatic.

18:46.640 --> 18:48.060
Uh-oh...

18:48.060 --> 18:50.650
Excuse me, can we get 
something to wipe this up?

18:50.970 --> 18:53.600
Oh, this isn't good! Not good at all!

18:55.020 --> 18:59.530
Denji will swallow anything 
remotely nutritious!

19:04.900 --> 19:05.990
Pochita!

19:06.510 --> 19:08.250
I found something edible!

19:18.190 --> 19:19.380
Check it out, Pochita!

19:19.660 --> 19:22.520
Those rats are chowing on some drunk's puke!

19:22.520 --> 19:25.140
Eating puke! What a joke!

19:25.140 --> 19:27.770
What kinda mammals are they?!

19:31.550 --> 19:36.020
Unbelievable... Himeno has 
absolutely no restraint.

19:40.780 --> 19:43.090
My method for throwing up 
works pretty well, right?

19:43.090 --> 19:46.540
I used to look after my mom when 
she came home drunk from work.

19:47.040 --> 19:50.740
Not that it makes me as good 
a Devil Hunter as you.

19:51.490 --> 19:52.790
I'm pretty jealous.

19:54.420 --> 19:56.290
Jealous?!

19:56.290 --> 20:00.780
Dude... My first kiss tasted like barf!

20:00.780 --> 20:02.680
And you're jealous?!

20:12.240 --> 20:15.070
I'll see Hayakawa and his household home.

20:13.930 --> 20:15.070
You wanna drop by somewhere else?

20:15.070 --> 20:16.860
I drank a lot...

20:15.070 --> 20:17.310
Arai, look after Himeno.

20:17.320 --> 20:21.440
Ms. Makima paid the tab tonight, 
everyone, so show your gratitude.

20:21.730 --> 20:25.090
Nothing tastes better than 
drinks someone else paid for.

20:25.090 --> 20:25.820
Yep.

20:28.610 --> 20:30.700
Huh? Where's Denji?

20:30.700 --> 20:35.080
I saw Himeno pick him up 
and walk off somewhere.

20:39.340 --> 20:41.840
It's dark... So dark...

20:42.330 --> 20:44.550
Where the hell am I?

20:44.550 --> 20:48.590
Water... Water... Water...

20:49.790 --> 20:53.940
Come to think of it, the puke 
girl gave me a barf kiss.

20:54.710 --> 20:58.970
Damn it! Water, water...

21:16.940 --> 21:20.460
Huh... It's Den-Den-Denji?

21:20.460 --> 21:23.100
What are you doing in my place?

21:25.000 --> 21:27.670
Did I bring you here?

21:27.670 --> 21:29.010
Huh?

21:30.560 --> 21:33.990
I'm so dizzy... What the hell?

21:37.860 --> 21:42.070
Y'know, I noticed you're 
head over heels for Makima.

21:43.570 --> 21:45.570
My head's spinning...

21:45.990 --> 21:50.460
You could do better than 
that bitch, seriously.

21:50.460 --> 21:56.250
You and Aki, fawning all over her! Ugh...

21:56.250 --> 21:57.570
Seriously!

21:57.570 --> 21:58.640
Moo-ve on!

22:23.240 --> 22:24.290
Wanna do it?

22:24.820 --> 22:25.270


22:41.750 --> 22:48.800
m 199 189 l 326 189 326 231 199 231

22:41.750 --> 22:48.800
Sorry...
I got a little lost.

22:44.630 --> 22:46.300
This is good. 
It's been too long.

22:44.630 --> 22:46.460
m 407 124 l 490 124 490 149 407 149

22:45.380 --> 22:46.800
I don't drink
much at home, too.

